  "story": "In February 1508 the men of Prince Michael Glinski killed his enemy, Marshal Jan Zabrzeziński, near Grodno, and Glinski went over to Vasily III. With two or three thousand horse and Muscovite detachments he marched on the towns of the Duchy. Slutsk is ruled by the widowed Princess Anastasia for her son Yuri, sixteen years old. The rebels have no guns that can break a wall: only ladders, fire and cavalry. Andrei Gintovt has come with the men who came back from the Vedrosha.",
  "goal": "Prepare the castle, beat back the first assault, burn the ladder workshops in a sortie, hold the night assault and the fire, and hold out until the rebels leave.",
  "lose": ["The Upper castle is taken", "Andrei Gintovt, Princess Anastasia or Prince Yuri falls"]
