    {"do": "cutscene", "id": "the_princess", "at": [29, 47], "lines": [["Chronicler", "That year Prince Michael Glinski, a learned and proud man, killed his enemy, Lord Zabrzeziński, and raised a revolt. He called the Ruthenian princes to follow him, and he called for help from Moscow. The princess of Slutsk did not follow him."], ["hero_andrei", "Princess, standard-bearer Gintovt with his men. The hetman is gathering the army and has sent us ahead."], ["hero_anastasia", "How many of you?"], ["hero_andrei", "As many as came back from the Vedrosha."], ["hero_anastasia", "Then men who know how to retreat. You will not need that skill here. We have nowhere to retreat to."]]},
    {"do": "objective", "id": "prepare", "text": "Prepare the castle: shooters on the walls, the townsmen inside"},
